<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ko"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2068166057"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1708074560"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="B.O.M.B"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="TREASURE"/><amll:meta key="album" value="2ND FULL ALBUM 'REBOOT'"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:21.251"><div begin="00:03.869" end="03:16.082"><p begin="00:03.869" end="00:06.142" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">My heart is going crazy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心疯狂跳动</span></p><p begin="00:05.863" end="00:07.046" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">I’m crazy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已陷入疯狂</span></p><p begin="00:07.046" end="00:09.104" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">1, 2, 3, Let's go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">1 2 3 出发吧</span></p><p begin="00:09.581" end="00:12.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">너를 볼 때면 난 계속<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一见到你</span></p><p begin="00:13.509" end="00:16.801" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">입가에 미소가 막 번지게 돼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘴角的笑容便止不住</span></p><p begin="00:17.505" end="00:20.167" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">부디 날 숨 좀 쉬게 해 줘<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请给我点喘息的空间吧</span></p><p begin="00:20.846" end="00:22.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Please don’t make me a fool<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要让我成为爱的傻瓜</span></p><p begin="00:22.823" end="00:24.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">날 떨리게 해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我小鹿乱撞</span></p><p begin="00:25.101" end="00:27.105" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">눈앞이 전부 캄캄해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼前一片漆黑</span></p><p begin="00:27.105" end="00:29.286" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">불을 밝혀 줘 Just like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请为我点亮灯光 照亮我心</span></p><p begin="00:29.623" end="00:32.265" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">나에게만 Give me, give your love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的爱 请只给我一个人</span></p><p begin="00:32.840" end="00:35.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">온종일 나의 생각 속엔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的脑海里</span></p><p begin="00:35.103" end="00:37.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">너로 가득 차 Just like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终日是你的身影 无法抹去</span></p><p begin="00:37.646" end="00:39.789" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Hey, can you hear my heartbeat?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能听见我的心跳声吗</span></p><p begin="00:39.888" end="00:43.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">내 심장은 Boom ba ra bi BOMB, BOMB<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心脏</span></p><p begin="00:43.344" end="00:45.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">사랑을 던진다<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扔下一颗爱情炸弹</span></p><p begin="00:45.381" end="00:47.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">네 맘에 터져라<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让它在你心中点燃</span></p><p begin="00:47.344" end="00:49.584" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">You're my love, I'm falling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我的至爱 我为你倾心</span></p><p begin="00:48.845" end="00:51.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">눈을 맞춰 Feel me now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我四目相对 感受我的心意吧</span></p><p begin="00:51.380" end="00:52.866" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">I want you, baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 我渴望着你</span></p><p begin="00:52.866" end="00:55.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Ooh you make me crazy now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我陷入疯狂</span></p><p begin="00:55.840" end="00:59.341" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">내 심장은 Boom ba ra bi BOMB, BOMB<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心脏</span></p><p begin="00:59.341" end="01:01.341" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">사랑을 던진다<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扔下一颗爱情炸弹</span></p><p begin="01:01.361" end="01:03.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">네 맘에 터져라<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让它在你心中点燃</span></p><p begin="01:03.380" end="01:05.483" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">You're my love, I'm falling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我的至爱 我为你倾心</span></p><p begin="01:04.842" end="01:07.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">눈을 맞춰 Feel me now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我四目相对 感受我的心意吧</span></p><p begin="01:07.345" end="01:08.804" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">I want you, baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 我渴望着你</span></p><p begin="01:08.824" end="01:11.828" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">오늘만큼은 나에게 달려와<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天请来到我身边</span></p><p begin="01:11.828" end="01:14.126" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Love me now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就好好爱我</span></p><p begin="01:13.487" end="01:15.249" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">이 밤이 밝혀진 순간<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当这个夜晚被点亮</span></p><p begin="01:15.607" end="01:17.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">바라봐 줘 내 눈만<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请你望向我的双眼</span></p><p begin="01:17.589" end="01:20.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">빛이 나는 네가 내 맘에 자꾸 불을 붙여<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是那么耀眼</span></p><p begin="01:20.485" end="01:21.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Help me now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我的心房纵火</span></p><p begin="01:21.100" end="01:23.067" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">난 항상 너를 보면<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">帮帮我</span></p><p begin="01:23.121" end="01:25.121" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">빨라지는 심장의 속도<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳便会加速</span></p><p begin="01:24.865" end="01:26.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">몸이 너에게 반응하네<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身体不自觉做出反应</span></p><p begin="01:26.609" end="01:29.241" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">머릿속에 Spark이 터진 듯해 BOMB<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脑海中 爱情火花在迸溅</span></p><p begin="01:29.124" end="01:31.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">눈앞이 전부 캄캄해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼前一片漆黑</span></p><p begin="01:31.109" end="01:33.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">불을 밝혀 줘 Just like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请为我点亮灯光 照亮我心</span></p><p begin="01:33.648" end="01:36.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">나에게만 Give me, give your love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的爱 请只给我一个人</span></p><p begin="01:36.847" end="01:39.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">온종일 나의 생각 속엔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的脑海里</span></p><p begin="01:39.103" end="01:41.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">너로 가득 차 Just like this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终日是你的身影 无法抹去</span></p><p begin="01:41.606" end="01:43.626" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Hey, can you hear my heartbeat?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能听见我的心跳声吗</span></p><p begin="01:43.880" end="01:47.343" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">내 심장은 Boom ba ra bi BOMB, BOMB<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心脏</span></p><p begin="01:47.347" end="01:49.361" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">사랑을 던진다<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扔下一颗爱情炸弹</span></p><p begin="01:49.365" end="01:51.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">네 맘에 터져라<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让它在你心中点燃</span></p><p begin="01:51.344" end="01:53.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">You're my love, I'm falling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我的至爱 我为你倾心</span></p><p begin="01:52.825" end="01:55.307" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">눈을 맞춰 Feel me now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我四目相对 感受我的心意吧</span></p><p begin="01:55.345" end="01:56.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">I want you, baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 我渴望着你</span></p><p begin="01:56.865" end="01:59.702" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Ooh you make me crazy now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我陷入疯狂</span></p><p begin="01:59.846" end="02:03.349" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">내 심장은 Boom ba ra bi BOMB, BOMB<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心脏</span></p><p begin="02:03.349" end="02:05.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">사랑을 던진다<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扔下一颗爱情炸弹</span></p><p begin="02:05.387" end="02:07.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">네 맘에 터져라<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让它在你心中点燃</span></p><p begin="02:07.365" end="02:09.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">You're my love, I'm falling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我的至爱 我为你倾心</span></p><p begin="02:08.863" end="02:11.329" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">눈을 맞춰 Feel me now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我四目相对 感受我的心意吧</span></p><p begin="02:11.342" end="02:12.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">I want you, baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 我渴望着你</span></p><p begin="02:12.860" end="02:15.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">오늘만큼은 나에게 달려와<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天请来到我身边</span></p><p begin="02:15.880" end="02:18.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">Love me now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就好好爱我</span></p><p begin="02:18.842" end="02:24.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">Ooh, ohh, ohh</p><p begin="02:24.348" end="02:27.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">I wanna know what you do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想知道你有何魔力吸引着我</span></p><p begin="02:27.823" end="02:31.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">아무리 애를 써도 알 수 없네<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论我如何努力 都无法知晓</span></p><p begin="02:31.860" end="02:34.088" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">복잡한 내 마음들도<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便内心很复杂</span></p><p begin="02:34.088" end="02:36.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">솔직한 마음으로<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我想以真挚待你</span></p><p begin="02:36.842" end="02:39.543" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">널 향해 나를 터트린다<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无条件为你付出我的爱</span></p><p begin="02:41.864" end="02:45.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">내 심장은 Boom ba ra bi BOMB, BOMB<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心脏</span></p><p begin="02:45.344" end="02:47.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">(OK, just love me like that)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样好好爱我</span></p><p begin="02:47.360" end="02:49.484" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">네 맘에 터져라<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让它在你心中点燃</span></p><p begin="02:50.885" end="02:53.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">눈을 맞춰 Feel me now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我四目相对 感受我的心意吧</span></p><p begin="02:53.350" end="02:54.843" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">I want you, baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 我渴望着你</span></p><p begin="02:54.866" end="02:57.846" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70">Ooh, you make me crazy now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我陷入疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:57.847" end="03:01.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71">내 심장은 Boom ba ra bi BOMB, BOMB<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心脏</span></p><p begin="03:01.348" end="03:03.105" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72">(OK, just love me like that)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样好好爱我</span></p><p begin="03:03.375" end="03:05.508" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73">네 맘에 터져라<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让它在你心中点燃</span></p><p begin="03:06.863" end="03:09.349" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L74">눈을 맞춰 Feel me now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我四目相对 感受我的心意吧</span></p><p begin="03:09.349" end="03:10.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L75">I want you, baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 我渴望着你</span></p><p begin="03:10.864" end="03:13.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76">오늘만큼은 나에게 달려와<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天请来到我身边</span></p><p begin="03:13.882" end="03:16.082" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L77">Love me now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就好好爱我</span></p></div></body></tt>